WEBVTT

00:00:59.972 --> 00:01:02.975
I get emotional every time I see it fly.

00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:05.937
In my work as an artist,

00:01:05.937 --> 00:01:08.981
I ask a lot of questions
about the world around me.

00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:14.070
While the problems of the world
don't have easy solutions,

00:01:14.112 --> 00:01:17.657
I think it's as important
to ask the right questions.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.745
Why do our technologies
instill so much fear in us?

00:01:24.122 --> 00:01:27.667
Why do our lives today feel so alienating,

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:31.420
when our technologies
are supposed to improve our lives?